doc.add_heading('Response to reviewers',0)
p('QAOA-Simulated Global Pressure-Based Energy Optimization for Traffic Signal Control')
p('Author: Arnav Jha | Editor: Shireesh Apte')
p('Dear Dr. Apte and Reviewers,')
p('Thank you for the detailed evaluation of the manuscript. The revision expands the study to include a classical global comparison, exact energy benchmarking, a nine-intersection network, additional adaptive traffic controllers, repeated-run statistical analyses, and QAOA sensitivity experiments. The responses below identify the corresponding manuscript sections and explain the scope and limitations of the evidence.')
p('Each open-response comment is reproduced verbatim and answered separately, including the introductory and concluding comments. Page references refer to the supplied 86-page revised PDF. Items marked “Correction required before resubmission” identify changes still needed before the response can represent a completed revision; they should be resolved and the associated response updated before submission. Figure numbers identify the manuscript’s intended figures, several of which remain placeholders in the supplied PDF.')
